              "props": {
                "html": "<p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151\">Hi {{first_name}}, if you’re preparing to shop for a home, a mortgage preapproval can help you understand your options and what information a lender needs.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold\">Do you have a target month for your move?</p>",
